Cell["\<\
So I\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll use some jargon for those with at least 4 successes \
(80%), at least 8 successes (96%) and 3 or fewer (kind of iffy).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9940878837796926`*^9, 
