d9b6136fa16e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "I ran some experiments with 192 trials (48 hours, 15 minutes per trial). \
With 95% credibility, the probability of at least one success in 8 hours \
given ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["m", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "b16de15c-ad18-4248-88be-944ba1db54b9"],
 " out of the first 196 is at least the numbers in this table. The result for \
1 is funny."
}], "Text",
